//! [`handshake`]: fn.handshake.html
//! [executor]: https://docs.rs/futures/0.1/futures/future/trait.Executor.html
//! [`SendRequest`]: struct.SendRequest.html
//! [`SendStream`]: ../struct.SendStream.html
